03.md`, the shared foreign data-store adapter contract decision record for #5803.\n\n- Establishes registered ID-level source references, keeps adapter-native locators and credentials local, and defines the common type-mapping, read-mode, failure, and provenance boundaries.\n- Resolves live/materialized policy as adapter capability + owner selection, with adapter-specific defaults and no silent stale fallback; v1 is read-only.\n- Dispositions p2panda as a deferred interop/export candidate, not a v1 table adapter.\n- Applies #5672 grant/existence-privacy constraints without changing grant, revocation, or delegation decisions. It explicitly marks grantee error collapsing as a conservative adapter assumption because #5672 leaves that exact question open.\n- Reconciles #5804 IndexedDB and #5806 libsql decisions, including owner-only physical locator provenance and explicit tagging for out-of-range BigInt.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Documentation-only; `git diff --cached --check` passed.\n- IndexedDB relative link target exists.\n- Independent read-only consistency review completed; all findings addressed.\n- No code tests apply.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796741849&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7739&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7739&signature=58306ae9e8ba183f26b9410c4b42f811fbcad0b23ddc32023071c40c1e4766cc\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https: